# Accepted Trivy findings. Every entry needs a reason; review them regularly.

# DS-0026: Dockerfile HEALTHCHECK. The distroless image has no shell or curl
# to run one, and Kubernetes ignores Docker HEALTHCHECK; liveness/readiness
# probes in deploy/k8s cover this.
DS-0026

# KSV-0125: "image from untrusted registry". Trivy's default trusted list does
# not include ghcr.io; registry trust is enforced at admission by the Kyverno
# verify-image-signature policy instead.
KSV-0125
